sha256.c and sha256.h are THC's own implementation of SHA-256 (FIPS 180-4), HMAC (RFC 2104) and
PBKDF2 (RFC 8018), written for THC and released into the public domain under the Unlicense,
like the rest of THC. They contain no code from any other project. They are checked against the
published test vectors in tests/test_pin.c.
